{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14799","headline":"和常舍人晚秋集贤院即事十二韵寄赠江南徐薛二侍郎 · 卢纶","name":"和常舍人晚秋集贤院即事十二韵寄赠江南徐薛二侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纶阁九华前，森沈彩仗连。\n洞门开旭日，清禁肃秋天。\n霜满朝容备，钟余漏唱传。\n摇璫陪羽扇，端弁入炉烟。\n麟笔删金篆，龙绡荐玉编。\n汲书荀勖定，汉史蔡邕专。\n御竹潜通笋，宫池暗泻泉。\n乱藂萦弱蕙，堕叶洒枯莲。\n列署齐游日，重江并谪年。\n登封思议草，侍讲忆同筵。\n沧海风涛广，黝山瘴雨偏。\n唯应缄上宝，赠远一呈妍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}